{"id": 359, "forum": "17-seminary-vystavki-vebinary", "title": "Практический семинар в Калининграде 07.10.2023", "posts": [{"id": 2390, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2023-10-11", "html": "<p>07 октября 2023 Дмитрий Петров провёл выездной практический семинар в Калининграде. В процессе обучения был построен БКВ-ручей. В процессе строительства двенадцать слушателей семинара на практике ознакомились с технологией строительства подобных водных объектов.</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_457ffb67392f2817d0035faebf037bc4", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0050.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_48c7d68706443440616e56f13f0e87c7", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0060.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_4ef87bad0b84ff114aa4365eeca28c36", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0480.JPG"}]}, {"id": 2391, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2023-10-11", "html": "<p>Фототчёт о ходе строительства ручья.</p><p>Подготовка котлована; монтаж гидроизоляции; установка насосной камеры и акваблоков.</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_42142fed56f77d0dcb5f598bb5413420", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0110.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_f7f0f8ca2e2d98c1f13c765bebcbdaad", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0120.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_fd0e2d70a86bc715cabffc824e145234", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0130.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_2584f457f0f8263d8a39f7a7fdd8ffd0", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0140.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_c1ad79ea5fd4c881a4cd72b87fb49578", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0150.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_22cc455b918ee354d3b88bfb5cba4f12", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0160.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_3f3b9ffb65c228f929bbcbc8eef2f03f", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0100.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_db4b0f44f7ff05db1a8e7aacbf0f9f04", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0170.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_c018fbcf6b25fe80d9b261a5192ce36b", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0180.JPG"}]}, {"id": 2392, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2023-10-11", "html": "<p>Формирование горки и русла ручья. Гидроизоляция русла ручья. Проверка гидроизоляции.</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_3da938c15f73f33ed10d0c9ccac9d7ed", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0190.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_95a38006b3f086f1be8d0f7eccfb05ad", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0200.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_b5a71ec598ba41c681e0e44c67270529", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0210.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_f69600d4b10c55cf1c260e16c6bf356a", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0220.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_93801908e4dad240e711cd1d8b4093e2", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0230.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_02bda6ac23c306f7a55e8844deb0472d", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0240.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_2345d8ec5991664ba3eafae749e573c3", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0250.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_3a594eaa95e6afd8e6308dbae66f24ec", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0260.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_04dd9553d9c9808aed2b0e3c3d34ed1f", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0270.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_b16618e08bfba6bef69c7a79e9b70209", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0270.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_0a08ed57d4f91bf381194ab450af20a1", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0280.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_20a615832f20a54a9c62b87ded7bb0d4", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0290.JPG"}]}, {"id": 2393, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2023-10-11", "html": "<p>Монтаж оборудование</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_1bb3612cd88421076ff1e8c6f58397a7", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0300.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_c208fe05cf163966472b8b8100e2c299", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0310.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_c1233b3df7108ff88ba650ff0e843d79", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0320.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_77c2a2d9782fb1e99655c3560bcee4b8", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0330.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_d0a91176c66286df350d6eab96d32296", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0340.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_ee15c2e0264c399535ff49b13c7e6841", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0350.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_bedf4076cbf30334ab2f43b701332e87", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0360.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_38270dba01c2a9fabf40f29dbdd5d53f", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0370.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_1d888e4176a4ca89ae75cea70c7195d1", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0380.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_549f3e41b11766ed3d8e97f1e3013e0e", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0390.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_204c150bdc278f614f82c5d1cf8461a4", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0400.JPG"}]}, {"id": 2394, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2023-10-11", "html": "<p>Декорация русла ручья. Заполнение водой. Запуск</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_0ace8db03bfcc5df2fd83b561441ce18", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0410.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_6f02e858afc9974dbb4bf67172b21eec", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0420.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_e6a5dc059d8cb2ce766ad117c9170ab6", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0430.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_ccb50c677e5781241f63fe298401ad45", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0440.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_f2bdc134c9cb23df9d3df5ce127b66db", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0450.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_7906d125544aad79e9a82382a640fe4a", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0460.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_902734cd6411ccab6b17e17bea3e6b3f", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0470.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_39b31a83fba16ba1926ad17262d747d4", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0480.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_d25a5107635c3a23ba7273c94f2e785a", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0490.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_14ce7355e154da14a964969fc3335a39", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0500.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_03f2b50ce4f23c182f7e764da3d8e0b2", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0510.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_8a9d6454b7cf4264122ea3bd9d821c39", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.0520.JPG"}]}, {"id": 2395, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2023-10-11", "html": "<p>Видеоотчёт о семинаре: <div class=\"video-box\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/UWcHTJ0PKzw\" loading=\"lazy\" allow=\"fullscreen; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen></iframe></div></p>", "photos": []}, {"id": 2579, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2024-08-14", "html": "<p>Прошёл почти год с момента проведения семинара в Калининграде, во время которого было построено три водных объекта: ручей, мельничные камни и японский излив.<br>За год водоёмы замечательно вписались в окружающий ландшафт.<br>Надеемся, что и слушатели семинара за этот год смогли применить полученные знания при строительстве водоёмов.</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_65bfe9635284b6ecde20be8c85d22759", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.049.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_c2e39fc2a7af49f4a330a415c42f6627", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.050.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_886f594c230f3a49982390f1c9afcd30", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.051.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_c99aae03aa05b32f1482155b23890e07", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.053.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_f9af7e8fae964099d4560bdff40938d8", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.055.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_bf69d2065dc192bc83364b79ec0058c5", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.052.JPG"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_1e2ec36384419bf6b460e7b19606c257", "thumb": "", "name": "klg2023.054.JPG"}]}]}